    "What is an AI HDRI Generator and how does it work?": "AI HDRI 生成器如何工作？",
    "Generate a 2:1 environment image from text or reference images, then preview or export it. Radiance .HDR export wraps image values in RGBE format; it does not recover measured scene radiance from an ordinary image.": "从文字或参考图片生成 2:1 环境图，再预览或导出。Radiance .HDR 将图片值封装为 RGBE，并不会从普通图片恢复真实场景的测量辐射信息。",
    "Can I export in Radiance .HDR or EXR format for Blender and Unreal Engine?": "能导出供 Blender 或 Unreal 使用的 .HDR 或 EXR 吗？",
    "PNG, Radiance .HDR and six-face PNG ZIP workflows are available. OpenEXR is not supported. PNG faces are display images, not an Unreal TextureCube asset; check engine format requirements before importing.": "提供 PNG、Radiance .HDR 和六面 PNG ZIP 工作流。不支持 OpenEXR。PNG 六面是显示图片，不是 Unreal TextureCube 资源；导入前请核对引擎格式要求。",
    "How does 360 Panorama Viewer solve the 360° boundary seam problem?": "如何处理 360° 边界接缝？",
    "Seam blending smooths the left and right image boundaries. Inspect the full rotation after generation; visible artifacts can remain and results depend on the source image.": "接缝融合使左右边界过渡更平滑。生成后请检查完整一圈，仍可能存在瑕疵，效果取决于原图。",
    "Is this suitable for realistic lighting and reflection probes in 3D scenes?": "适合真实光照与反射探针吗？",
    "Generated environments are useful for visual exploration. They are not calibrated lighting measurements. For physically accurate illumination, use a measured HDR source and verify exposure and orientation in your 3D software.": "生成环境适合视觉探索，但不是经过校准的光照测量。物理准确的照明请使用实测 HDR，并在三维软件中检查曝光和朝向。",
    "Is the AI HDRI Generator free to use?": "AI HDRI 生成器免费吗？",
    "Local viewing and PNG slicing are free. AI generation uses credits; any trial allowance depends on current availability and the account display.": "本地查看和 PNG 切图免费。AI 生成需要积分，试用额度以当前可用情况和账户显示为准。",
    "How do I import the generated HDRI into Blender?": "如何将环境图导入 Blender？",
    "In Blender, open the Shader Editor and switch from Object to World mode. Add an \"Environment Texture\" node, connect its Color output to the Background node Color input, and open your downloaded equirectangular file. Set the projection to Equirectangular to instantly light your scene.": "在 Blender 的 Shader Editor 中切换到 World。添加 Environment Texture，将其 Color 连接到 Background 的 Color，打开等距柱状文件并设置 Equirectangular 投影，再检查场景光照。",
